{
  "sn3.19:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 3.19 ",
  "sn3.19:0.2": "2. Dutiyavagga ",
  "sn3.19:0.3": "Paṭhamaaputtakasutta ",
  "sn3.19:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn3.19:1.2": "Atha kho rājā pasenadi kosalo divā divassa yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho rājānaṁ pasenadiṁ kosalaṁ bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "sn3.19:1.3": "“handa kuto nu tvaṁ, mahārāja, āgacchasi divā divassā”ti? ",
  "sn3.19:2.1": "“Idha, bhante, sāvatthiyaṁ seṭṭhi gahapati kālaṅkato. ",
  "sn3.19:2.2": "Tamahaṁ aputtakaṁ sāpateyyaṁ rājantepuraṁ atiharitvā āgacchāmi. ",
  "sn3.19:2.3": "Asīti, bhante, satasahassāni hiraññasseva, ko pana vādo rūpiyassa. ",
  "sn3.19:2.4": "Tassa kho pana, bhante, seṭṭhissa gahapatissa evarūpo bhattabhogo ahosi—",
  "sn3.19:2.5": "kaṇājakaṁ bhuñjati bilaṅgadutiyaṁ. ",
  "sn3.19:2.6": "Evarūpo vatthabhogo ahosi—",
  "sn3.19:2.7": "sāṇaṁ dhāreti tipakkhavasanaṁ. ",
  "sn3.19:2.8": "Evarūpo yānabhogo ahosi—",
  "sn3.19:2.9": "jajjararathakena yāti paṇṇachattakena dhāriyamānenā”ti. ",
  "sn3.19:3.1": "“Evametaṁ, mahārāja, evametaṁ, mahārāja. ",
  "sn3.19:3.2": "Asappuriso kho, mahārāja, uḷāre bhoge labhitvā nevattānaṁ sukheti pīṇeti, na mātāpitaro sukheti pīṇeti, na puttadāraṁ sukheti pīṇeti, na dāsakammakaraporise sukheti pīṇeti, na mittāmacce sukheti pīṇeti, na samaṇabrāhmaṇesu uddhaggik